# Website Sekolah SMK PGRI Wonoasri v2.1

Website profil sekolah modern yang dibangun dengan Next.js 16, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Prisma ORM, dan SQLite database.

## Fitur Utama

### Frontend (User Side)
- ✅ Hero section fullscreen dengan slogan sekolah
- ✅ Navbar transparan yang berubah saat scroll
- ✅ Smooth scrolling
- ✅ Section Profil Sekolah
- ✅ Visi dan Misi
- ✅ Program Keahlian (6 jurusan)
- ✅ Fasilitas Sekolah
- ✅ Berita Terbaru (dinamis dari database)
- ✅ Galeri Kegiatan (dinamis dari database)
- ✅ Kontak dan Google Maps embed
- ✅ Footer lengkap dengan sosial media
- ✅ Responsive mobile-friendly
- ✅ Animasi ringan (fade-in, hover effects, glassmorphism)

### Backend (Admin Panel)
- ✅ Login & Logout menggunakan session
- ✅ Password menggunakan bcrypt hashing
- ✅ Dashboard admin modern dengan analytics
- ✅ **Analytics Dashboard** (Visitor tracking, User activity, Click analytics)
- ✅ CRUD Berita (judul, isi, upload gambar, tanggal otomatis)
- ✅ CRUD Galeri (judul, upload gambar, hapus)
- ✅ **CRUD Dokumen Kegiatan** (juklak, juknis, PDF upload)
- ✅ Validasi upload file (maks 2MB untuk gambar, 5MB untuk PDF)
- ✅ Proteksi halaman admin

## Teknologi

- **Framework**: Next.js 16 dengan App Router
- **Language**: TypeScript 5
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 4
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui
- **Database**: SQLite dengan Prisma ORM
- **Authentication**: Session-based dengan bcryptjs
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Runtime**: Bun

## Struktur Database

### users
- id (String, primary key)
- username (String, unique)
- password (String, hashed with bcrypt)
- role (String, default: "admin")
- created_at (DateTime)
- updated_at (DateTime)
- Relasi dengan UserLog

### berita
- id (String, primary key)
- judul (String)
- isi (String)
- gambar (String, optional)
- created_at (DateTime)
- updated_at (DateTime)

### galeri
- id (String, primary key)
- judul (String)
- gambar (String)
- created_at (DateTime)
- updated_at (DateTime)

### program_content
- Data 6 program keahlian (DKV, TKJ, KC, BDP, AK, MPLB)
- Termasuk visi, misi, kompetensi, dll

### dokumen_kegiatan
- id (String, primary key)
- judul_kegiatan (String)
- deskripsi (String)
- file_juklak (String, optional - PDF)
- file_juknis (String, optional - PDF)
- status (Boolean, default: false)
- created_at (DateTime)
- updated_at (DateTime)

### visitor_log
- id (String, primary key)
- ip (String, optional)
- user_agent (String, optional)
- visited_at (DateTime)

### user_log
- id (String, primary key)
- user_id (String, foreign key ke User)
- action (String)
- details (String, optional)
- created_at (DateTime)
- Relasi dengan User

### click_analytics
- id (String, primary key)
- user_id (String, optional)
- content_type (String)
- content_name (String)
- content_id (String, optional)
- clicked_at (DateTime)

### setting
- id (String, primary key)
- key (String, unique)
- value (String)
- created_at (DateTime)
- updated_at (DateTime)

## Instalasi & Menjalankan

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ 
- Bun (recommended) atau npm
- Git

### Setup Database SQLite

SQLite sudah built-in dengan project ini, tidak perlu instalasi database server terpisah. Database file akan otomatis dibuat di folder `db/`.

Contoh `.env`:
```env
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
```

### Langkah-langkah

1. **Clone repository**
```bash
git clone https://github.com/riskyoke22/website-smkpgriv2.1.git
cd website-smkpgriv2.1
```

2. **Install dependencies**
```bash
bun install
```

3. **Setup environment**
```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

4. **Setup database**
```bash
# Push schema ke database SQLite
bun run db:push

# Seed database dengan admin user dan sample data
bun run seed
```

5. **Jalankan development server**
```bash
bun run dev
```

6. **Buka browser**
```
http://localhost:3000
```

### Login Admin

- **URL**: http://localhost:3000/admin
- **Username**: `admin` atau `cleo`
- **Password**: `admin123` atau `cleo123`

## Struktur Folder

```
/
├── prisma/
│   ├── schema.prisma       # Schema database SQLite
│   ├── seed.ts             # Seed script
│   ├── seed-program-contents.ts    # Program content seed
│   └── seed-settings.ts    # Settings seed
├── public/
│   └── uploads/            # Folder upload file
│       ├── berita/
│       ├── galeri/
│       └── dokumen/         # Upload dokumen kegiatan (PDF)
├── scripts/
│   └── setup-sqlite.sh     # SQLite setup script (optional)
├── src/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── admin/          # Halaman admin
│   │   │   ├── dashboard/
│   │   │   ├── analytics/    # Analytics dashboard
│   │   │   ├── berita/
│   │   │   ├── galeri/
│   │   │   └── dokumen-kegiatan/  # Manajemen dokumen
│   │   ├── api/            # API Routes
│   │   │   ├── auth/       # Authentication
│   │   │   ├── berita/     # Berita CRUD
│   │   │   ├── galeri/     # Galeri CRUD
│   │   │   ├── dokumen-kegiatan/  # Dokumen CRUD
│   │   │   ├── visitor/    # Visitor tracking
│   │   │   ├── user-logs/  # User activity logs
│   │   │   ├── track-click/ # Click analytics
│   │   │   └── upload/     # File upload (images & PDF)
│   │   └── page.tsx        # Landing page
│   ├── components/
│   │   └── ui/             # shadcn/ui components
│   └── lib/
│       └── db.ts           # Prisma client
├── package.json
└── SQLITE_SETUP.md         # SQLite setup guide
```

## API Routes

### Authentication
- `POST /api/auth/login` - Login admin
- `POST /api/auth/logout` - Logout admin
- `GET /api/auth/me` - Get current user

### Berita
- `GET /api/berita` - Get all berita
- `POST /api/berita` - Create new berita
- `GET /api/berita/[id]` - Get single berita
- `PUT /api/berita/[id]` - Update berita
- `DELETE /api/berita/[id]` - Delete berita

### Galeri
- `GET /api/galeri` - Get all galeri items
- `POST /api/galeri` - Create new galeri item
- `DELETE /api/galeri/[id]` - Delete galeri item

### Dokumen Kegiatan
- `GET /api/dokumen-kegiatan` - Get all dokumen kegiatan
- `GET /api/dokumen-kegiatan?active=true` - Get active dokumen kegiatan
- `POST /api/dokumen-kegiatan` - Create new dokumen kegiatan
- `GET /api/dokumen-kegiatan/[id]` - Get single dokumen kegiatan
- `PUT /api/dokumen-kegiatan/[id]` - Update dokumen kegiatan
- `DELETE /api/dokumen-kegiatan/[id]` - Delete dokumen kegiatan

### Analytics & Tracking
- `POST /api/visitor` - Log visitor visit
- `GET /api/visitor` - Get visitor statistics
- `GET /api/user-logs/stats` - Get user activity statistics (admin only)
- `POST /api/track-click` - Track click events
- `GET /api/track-click` - Get click analytics (admin only)

### Upload
- `POST /api/upload` - Upload image or PDF file
  - Images: JPG, PNG, WEBP (max 2MB)
  - PDF: max 5MB for documents

## Deployment

### Deployment ke Vercel (Recommended)

1. Push code ke GitHub
2. Import project ke Vercel
3. Configure environment variables
4. Deploy

### Manual Deployment

```bash
# Build project
bun run build

# Start production server
bun start
```

